WEBVTT

00:12.160 --> 00:13.910
<b>It’s like they’re balls!</b>

00:13.910 --> 00:17.000
<b>When Whaleko 
 fill their bodies up with water,</b>

00:17.000 --> 00:19.500
<b>they can bounce around like this.</b>

00:19.500 --> 00:22.250
<b>Whaleoh watching may be 
 what’s famous,</b>

00:22.250 --> 00:24.460
<b>but this is Whaleko watching.</b>

00:34.220 --> 00:35.770
<b>Good going, Pikachu!</b>

00:48.860 --> 00:49.860
<b>What’s that?</b>

00:57.700 --> 00:59.160
<b>It’s a Laplace.</b>

00:59.160 --> 01:01.420
<b>Don’t you think 
 it looks panicked?</b>

01:01.420 --> 01:03.590
<b>Yeah, it does.</b>

01:11.760 --> 01:12.840
<b>Pikachu...</b>

01:15.930 --> 01:19.430
<b>No way... Are you the one 
 I met in the Orange Archipelago?!</b>

01:20.690 --> 01:24.190
<b>I knew it! 
 Been doing good{NEP}, Laplace?</b>

01:25.110 --> 01:28.440
<b>Amazing! It <i>is</i> that Laplace!</b>

01:28.440 --> 01:30.610
<b>So it was migrating 
 through this area, huh?</b>

01:37.240 --> 01:39.410
<b>What’s wrong, Laplace?</b>

01:44.880 --> 01:47.170
<b>Is it saying “Come with me”?</b>

01:52.760 --> 01:54.840
<b>Right. Got it!</b>

