03:27.270 --> 03:32.690
Riding on Laplace♪

03:27.270 --> 03:32.690
Riding on Laplace♪

03:27.270 --> 03:32.690
Riding on Laplace♪

03:36.400 --> 03:40.660
<b>The Laplace who once went on adventures around 
 the Orange Archipelago with Satoshi...</b>

03:40.660 --> 03:43.910
<b>Where are our heroes now heading 
 as they ride on Laplace’s back?{Literally "Led by that Laplace, the place they head for is...?"}</b>

03:46.910 --> 03:49.000
<b>Is that it, Laplace?</b>

03:53.050 --> 03:54.840
<b>Wow...</b>

03:54.840 --> 03:56.590
<b>What an interesting island.</b>

03:56.590 --> 03:59.260
<b>It has holes and caves all over it.</b>

03:59.260 --> 04:04.560
<b>They must be the result of many years 
 of erosion from the seawater.</b>

04:04.560 --> 04:05.770
<b>Still...</b>

04:15.400 --> 04:17.530
<b>What’s up with everyone?</b>

04:41.470 --> 04:43.550
<b>Huh?! It’s a Whaleko!</b>

04:43.550 --> 04:45.720
<b>A Whaleko inside a hole!</b>

04:45.720 --> 04:46.770
<b>Huh?</b>

04:46.770 --> 04:49.560
<b>Is that what you wanted 
 to tell us about?</b>

04:53.690 --> 04:57.400
<b>It might have gotten itself stuck 
 from hopping around.</b>

04:57.780 --> 05:00.610
<b>Laplace, thanks for telling me!</b>

05:00.610 --> 05:02.620
<b>You can leave this to us!</b>

05:04.700 --> 05:08.580
<b>People and Pokémon have to 
 work together at times like these!</b>

05:12.500 --> 05:15.880
<b>Whaleko, I’m gonna get you 
 out of there for sure.</b>

05:32.140 --> 05:36.320
<b>O-ho! Laplace, Whaleko, 
 so many Pokémon!</b>

05:36.320 --> 05:38.820
<b>That’s perfect, meow. 
 Add in Pikachu...</b>

05:38.820 --> 05:41.150
<b>...and let’s catch 
 every one of them.</b>

05:43.030 --> 05:46.280
<b>But... What’s the brat boy doing?</b>

05:46.280 --> 05:48.790
<b>Let’s try getting 
 a little closer, meow.</b>

05:48.790 --> 05:50.620
<b>Go quietly...</b>

05:50.620 --> 05:53.000
<b>Quietly, quietly...</b>

05:59.260 --> 06:02.630
<b>No good. 
 We’ll just have to break the rock.</b>

06:05.090 --> 06:07.260
<b>Don’t worry! 
 You can leave it to me!</b>

06:08.760 --> 06:11.770
<b>Kingler, Negigaknight, 
 I choose you!</b>

06:15.770 --> 06:17.270
<b>Pikachu, I need you too!</b>

06:18.900 --> 06:21.280
<b>Okay, let’s do this in a single blow!</b>

06:21.900 --> 06:23.780
<b>Kingler, use Crabhammer.</b>

06:24.700 --> 06:26.660
<b>Negigaknight, 
 you use Brutal Swing.</b>

06:27.410 --> 06:29.620
<b>Pikachu, you use Iron Tail!</b>

06:52.180 --> 06:53.270
<b>Where’s Satoshi?</b>

06:58.860 --> 07:00.900
<b>Ow, ow, ow...</b>

07:04.610 --> 07:06.160
<b>Oh, I’m fine.</b>

07:06.820 --> 07:08.160
<b>Heracross!</b>

07:13.330 --> 07:16.330
<b>This rock is pretty tough.</b>

07:20.920 --> 07:23.170
<b>Sorry I scared you like that.</b>

07:25.050 --> 07:26.630
<b>You were a huge help, 
 Heracross.</b>

07:29.550 --> 07:32.390
<b>Laplace! 
 We’re not gonna give up!</b>

07:34.770 --> 07:37.520
<b>Satoshi, we should think of 
 another method.</b>

07:37.520 --> 07:38.150
<b>Then...</b>

07:39.360 --> 07:41.400
<b>This time, leave it to me!</b>

07:43.150 --> 07:46.900
<b>That’s right! What do you do with 
 Water Pokémon but fish them up?{When it comes to Water Pokemon, the number one thing [to do] is fishing them!}</b>

07:48.160 --> 07:51.780
<b>Okay, Kasumi. 
 Let’s fish it up together!</b>

07:51.780 --> 07:54.660
<b>So help me out, Bayleaf!</b>

07:55.250 --> 07:56.910
<b>Hey, it’s Bayleaf.</b>

07:58.370 --> 08:00.630
<b>We can play together later.</b>

08:00.630 --> 08:03.420
<b>Right now, I need your help.</b>

08:03.420 --> 08:05.760
<b>Okay then, 
 use Vine Whip on Kasumi.</b>

08:05.760 --> 08:06.300
<b>Huh?</b>

08:08.680 --> 08:10.260
<b>Huh? Huh?!</b>

08:12.930 --> 08:15.060
<b>Heracross, 
 you hold me in place.</b>

08:16.350 --> 08:19.350
<b>I get it now. 
 Nice having you here, Bayleaf.</b>

08:20.520 --> 08:23.230
<b>Whaleko! 
 This time, we’re getting you out!</b>

08:26.150 --> 08:28.320
<b>Ready, and...</b>

08:30.990 --> 08:31.740
<b>It’s hooked!</b>

08:31.740 --> 08:33.240
<b>All right... Pull!</b>

08:39.460 --> 08:40.620
<b>Keep going!</b>

08:40.620 --> 08:42.250
<b>Whaleko!</b>

08:57.730 --> 08:59.980
<b>Thanks, Negigaknight, Kingler!</b>

09:01.350 --> 09:03.860
<b>Numacraw, support Kasumi!</b>

09:07.110 --> 09:08.610
<b>Thanks, Numacraw.</b>

09:11.240 --> 09:14.240
<b>Satoshi, let’s go on 
 three-two-one!</b>

09:14.700 --> 09:15.240
<b>Yeah!</b>

09:15.870 --> 09:16.740
<b>Three...</b>

09:17.290 --> 09:18.250
<b>Two...</b>

09:18.660 --> 09:19.660
<b>One!</b>

09:27.130 --> 09:27.880
<b>We did it!</b>

09:27.880 --> 09:28.880
<b>It’s out!</b>

09:29.380 --> 09:30.510
<b>Success!</b>

10:04.960 --> 10:06.130
<b>Whaleko?</b>

10:06.630 --> 10:08.210
<b>Is it...</b>

10:08.210 --> 10:09.670
