10:34.070 --> 10:36.740
<b>Why evolve into a Whaleoh now?</b>

10:36.740 --> 10:41.040
<b>It was so happy 
 it overflowed with evolving power... maybe?</b>

10:41.040 --> 10:45.370
<b>{What awful timing... 
 What else can I say...?}What else can I say but... 
 what awful timing...</b>

10:52.010 --> 10:54.930
<b>Uh... What do we do?</b>

11:00.140 --> 11:04.520
<b>We fished up Whaleko, 
 but that won’t cut it for Whaleoh...{Sasuga. line}</b>

11:05.020 --> 11:07.650
<b>Yeah. 
 We’d need more manpower.</b>

11:07.650 --> 11:09.900
<b>Anyway, let’s head 
 back down for now.</b>

11:10.440 --> 11:10.900
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:14.650 --> 11:16.820
<b>Looks like some kinda 
 commotion, meow.</b>

11:16.820 --> 11:20.120
<b>That’s perfect. While they’re distracted, 
 we can snatch Pikachu quick—</b>

11:33.300 --> 11:35.300
<b>Pikachu, you’re ours, meow!</b>

11:35.300 --> 11:37.380
<b>Like a whatsit to a flame!</b>

11:37.380 --> 11:39.970
<b>We’ll catch Pikachu, 
 and what a great feeling it’ll be!</b>

11:41.310 --> 11:43.770
<b>Wha-Wha-What? “Lend us a hand”?</b>

11:44.230 --> 11:46.390
<b>Wha-Wha-What did you say?!</b>

11:46.390 --> 11:48.520
<b>Wha-Wha-What nerve!</b>

11:48.520 --> 11:51.020
<b>There’s no way I’d take orders 
 from an enemy like yo—</b>

11:53.730 --> 11:57.610
<b>Wh-Why is it I suddenly feel 
 in the mood to follow your orders?</b>

11:57.610 --> 12:00.030
<b>Wh-What may we do to...</b>

12:00.030 --> 12:02.450
<b>...b-be of help, meow?</b>

12:09.330 --> 12:11.710
<b>Can we really trust them?</b>

12:13.250 --> 12:15.920
<b>We’ve made a vow 
 with Mr. Pikachu, meow.</b>

12:17.220 --> 12:20.720
<b>We don’t have a choice. Right now, 
 we can’t look a gift Nyarth in the mouth.{Right now, we’d even take a Nyarth’s assistance.}{'neko no te mo karitai'->'[I'd] even like to borrow a cat's paws [to help]', so desperate you'd even consider asking a fickle cat for help. Takeshi swaps 'cat' for 'Nyarth'. Cat->Nyarth stuff is common enough, and the same idiom turns up enough (even the move named EN:Assist) that it may be best left as-is, even though EN viewers won't spot 'this is an idiom'...}</b>

12:20.720 --> 12:21.890
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:21.890 --> 12:26.730
<b>And that mecha will be a good 
 source of power to pull Whaleoh out.</b>

12:27.350 --> 12:28.940
<b>“Power,” he says...</b>

12:28.940 --> 12:30.810
<b>It’s human-powered...</b>

12:30.810 --> 12:32.980
<b>The sin of ignorance, meow.{Apparently dates back to Socrates}</b>

12:35.360 --> 12:37.240
<b>Great work, Pikachu!</b>

12:38.820 --> 12:41.820
<b>Look at that, 
 after he threatened us...</b>

12:41.820 --> 12:43.870
<b>What a schemer, meow...</b>

12:43.870 --> 12:46.370
<b>He’s much more evil than us.</b>

12:51.380 --> 12:53.040
<b>Oh, “Pikapika”...?</b>

12:53.040 --> 12:54.960
<b>Yes, we would be happy 
 to help you.</b>

12:54.960 --> 12:56.550
<b>We’ll do our best, meow!</b>

12:58.670 --> 13:00.010
<b>Come on out, Dodaitoise!</b>

13:04.010 --> 13:06.930
<b>Takeshi, you handle telling 
 Dodaitoise what to do.</b>

13:06.930 --> 13:09.890
<b>Sure, but... 
 What are you going to do?</b>

13:10.480 --> 13:13.020
<b>Okay, so, this is my plan.</b>

13:13.020 --> 13:19.150
<b>First, me, Heracross, and Bayleaf 
 get close to Whaleoh from inside the cave.</b>

13:19.150 --> 13:20.280
<b>Takeshi, you...</b>

13:20.280 --> 13:22.660
<b>Dodaitoise, use Hard Plant!</b>

13:22.660 --> 13:26.910
<b>...hold Whaleoh tight 
 with Dodaitoise’s Hard Plant.</b>

13:26.910 --> 13:29.040
<b>Kasumi, you give orders 
 to everyone on land.</b>

13:27.370 --> 13:29.040
<b>Gyarados!</b>

13:29.040 --> 13:32.210
<b>Team Rocket, 
 you get the Mecha Koiking moving.</b>

13:33.540 --> 13:36.550
<b>The Whaleko will 
 give Team Rocket support.</b>

13:36.550 --> 13:40.800
<b>Then, Laplace and everyone in the water, 
 and Kasumi and everyone on land...</b>

13:40.800 --> 13:43.260
<b>...can all pull out Whaleoh!</b>

13:51.560 --> 13:54.400
<b>To rescue the trapped Whaleoh!</b>

13:54.400 --> 13:57.400
<b>To live up to expectations!</b>

13:57.400 --> 14:00.490
<b>Giving the full power 
 of truth and love!</b>

14:00.490 --> 14:03.910
<b>We’re the lovely, charming help!</b>

14:03.910 --> 14:04.950
<b>Musashi!</b>

14:04.950 --> 14:06.120
<b>Kojiro!</b>

14:06.120 --> 14:10.120
<b>The Team Rocket duo 
 crosses the seas!</b>

14:10.120 --> 14:13.830
<b>Like a whirlpool, 
 whirling waves await us!</b>

14:13.830 --> 14:16.590
<b>Just kidding, meow!</b>

14:30.100 --> 14:32.100
<b>Keep it up, everyone!</b>

14:36.560 --> 14:38.440
<b>It started moving.</b>

14:39.190 --> 14:40.690
<b>Time for us to start!</b>

14:40.690 --> 14:42.860
<b>Bayleaf, use your Vine Whip!</b>

14:42.860 --> 14:44.950
<b>Heracross, use your Megahorn!</b>

14:45.570 --> 14:48.080
<b>Go all out...</b>

14:48.080 --> 14:50.080
<b>Tickle, tickle, tickle, 
 tickle, tickle, tickle, tickle!</b>

14:53.910 --> 14:55.330
<b>It’s working! It’s working!</b>

14:55.330 --> 14:56.960
<b>Please work!</b>

15:06.840 --> 15:08.800
<b>Looks like... it’s super effective!</b>

15:08.800 --> 15:11.930
<b>All right! Full power!</b>

15:11.930 --> 15:16.650
<b>Mecha Koiking turbo boost... 
 on, meow!</b>

15:42.000 --> 15:42.880
<b>What’s that?</b>

15:42.880 --> 15:44.380
<b>Heavy Bomber!</b>

15:51.640 --> 15:52.640
<b><i>We did it!</i></b>

15:56.640 --> 15:58.650
<b>Gyarados, guard us!</b>

16:01.320 --> 16:03.570
<b>Dodaitoise, prepare to escape!</b>

16:04.400 --> 16:06.950
<b>All right, 
 time to get out of here...</b>

16:06.950 --> 16:09.320
<b>We’ll catch Pikachu 
 without expending any effort.</b>

16:09.320 --> 16:11.580
<b>Meow... It couldn’t be...</b>

16:17.790 --> 16:19.420
<b>The hatch!</b>

16:19.420 --> 16:20.540
<b>Pikachu!</b>

16:21.340 --> 16:23.000
<b>Good work.</b>

16:23.000 --> 16:25.170
<b>Dodaitoise, time to escape!</b>

16:27.050 --> 16:31.140
<b><i>What an awful feeling!</i></b>

16:35.560 --> 16:36.850
<b>Kasumi!</b>

16:36.850 --> 16:38.100
<b>Where’s Satoshi?</b>

16:38.100 --> 16:39.310
<b>That’s the thing...</b>

16:50.860 --> 16:53.870
<b>No good. 
 It’s completely blocked.</b>

16:54.580 --> 16:56.870
<b>And the water’s rising...</b>

16:56.870 --> 16:58.500
<b>Return, Bayleaf.</b>

17:03.130 --> 17:05.300
<b>What other way out is there...?</b>

17:11.510 --> 17:13.100
<b>The tide’s rising!</b>

17:13.100 --> 17:14.350
<b>Huh?</b>

17:14.350 --> 17:15.970
<b>Then, the water in there...</b>

17:16.600 --> 17:18.230
<b>We have to save him, quick!</b>

17:18.230 --> 17:21.230
<b>But... How?!</b>

17:27.820 --> 17:28.610
<b>Laplace?</b>

17:59.640 --> 18:01.350
<b>Ice Beam?!</b>

18:01.350 --> 18:03.520
<b>It’s stopping the water 
 from flowing?</b>

18:04.770 --> 18:06.230
<b>What’s that?!</b>

18:09.570 --> 18:11.110
<b>Thanks, Heracross.</b>

18:15.490 --> 18:17.370
<b>Was that Laplace?</b>

18:24.330 --> 18:25.920
<b>Is this...?!</b>

18:33.300 --> 18:34.840
<b>Weather Ball?!</b>

19:07.920 --> 19:10.210
<b>Laplace! 
 You came for me!</b>

19:16.130 --> 19:18.010
<b>All right! Thank you!</b>

19:31.110 --> 19:32.980
<b>Yahoo!</b>

19:38.240 --> 19:40.490
<b>Thank you so much, Laplace.</b>

19:45.620 --> 19:48.170
<b>Sorry for worrying you, 
 Pikachu.</b>

19:55.720 --> 19:59.140
<b>Satoshi, Whaleoh helped, too.</b>

19:59.140 --> 20:02.260
<b>It made that tunnel in the ice.</b>

20:02.260 --> 20:05.560
<b>You did? Thank you, Whaleoh!</b>

20:23.700 --> 20:25.290
<b>Now, look after yourself.</b>

20:27.080 --> 20:28.670
<b>Let’s meet again sometime!</b>

20:33.340 --> 20:34.840
<b>Look!</b>

20:34.840 --> 20:37.050
<b>The Laplace herd!</b>

20:37.050 --> 20:39.090
<b>Are they here to pick it up?</b>

20:40.260 --> 20:43.560
<b>That’s right. 
 You were their leader.</b>

20:43.560 --> 20:45.100
<b>You keeping at it?</b>

20:47.850 --> 20:51.690
<b>I bet it saw that Whaleko in trouble 
 and couldn’t abandon it.</b>

20:51.690 --> 20:53.610
<b>Just like a certain someone.</b>

20:54.320 --> 20:56.490
<b>Huh? Who?</b>

20:56.490 --> 20:58.320
<b>He doesn’t even get it.</b>

21:16.250 --> 21:18.170
<b>Conducting a rescue 
 and being rescued in turn,</b>

21:18.840 --> 21:22.680
<b>their day with Laplace 
 came to an end.</b>

21:22.680 --> 21:26.520
<b>What sort of encounters 
 and adventures await them next?</b>

21:29.390 --> 21:30.440
<b>What is it?</b>

21:30.440 --> 21:34.020
<b>Couldn’t we have just caught 
 Whaleko in a Monster Ball?</b>

21:36.320 --> 21:39.030
<b>Eh, it’s fine. We had fun!</b>

